        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "RC4 implementation shipped inside the NPOI 2.1.3.1 library (class NPOI.HSSF.Record.Crypto.RC4), used to decrypt legacy RC4-encrypted Excel 97-2003 (.xls/BIFF) files. The project references NPOI.dll and NPOI.OOXML.dll (project/NFine.Code/NFine.Code.csproj:45-58) and compiles Excel\\NPOIExcel.cs, so the algorithm ships with the build. Observable here, replaceable only by the NPOI vendor — upgrading NPOI (which dropped legacy RC4 in later versions) is the remediation route. No application call site "
